  {
    "hotel_id": "10971",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/caravelle-saigon-hotel/hotel/ho-chi-minh-city-vn.html",
    "name": "Caravelle Saigon Hotel",
    "detail": "Outstanding customer service from Ms. Anh, one of the hotel reps in the Signature Lounge. She was super helpful in every way, arranged excellent show tickets for us for the AO performance in the Opera House which is conveniently just opposite the hotel, provided change for large denomination bills, and was generally willing to go out of her way to ensure our comfort and needs were met. The hotel is excellent in every way; we had a very comfortable and well-appointed room, the breakfast buffet is sumptuous and delicious, we enjoyed using both the swimming pool and gym, and there's even a Moet Chandon 'nook' within the lounge bar on the ground floor. The hotel's location is fantastic - we were able to walk to most places we wanted to visit - and there are excellent restaurants and shops nearby. The Caravelle definitely contributed to the pleasure of our stay in Ho Chi Minh city.",
